# Local .dev.vars for `wrangler dev` / `wrangler pages dev`
# Copy to .dev.vars if needed (git-ignored).
#
# By default, the Worker & Pages Functions run the built-in Cloudflare Edge
# Inertia + Auth handler with zero external backend required.
#
# Optional: proxy dynamic requests to a remote Laravel PHP origin
# BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
# Optional: Google OAuth 2.0 credentials on the edge
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
